---

<AboutLayout title="School Age Summer Camp | Wild Pear Preschool & Summer Camp">
  <ServicePage6
    title="School Age Summer Camp"
    description="Are you looking for fun, safe, outdoor camp-style care for your child? Wild Pear is thrilled to offer weekly science, art, and nature-based camps throughout the summer. Kids have plenty of time to play and enjoy their days while also diving into hands-on exploration of a variety of exciting topics."
    badge="Ages 5-10"
    image="/images/alexandr-podvalny-bh476ojZw2g-unsplash.jpg"
    imageWidth={6000}
    imageHeight={4000}
    highlights={[
      { label: "Ages", value: "2-10" },
      { label: "Hours", value: "7:30am-3:00pm" },
      { label: "Weekly", value: "June 22 - August 21, 2026" },
    ]}
    ctaText="Request a Tour"
    ctaHref="#request-tour"
  >
    <h2>Tuition & Schedule</h2>
    <div class="bg-accent/70 border-primary-accent my-8 border-l-4 p-[2em]">

      <h3>Dates</h3>
      <p>
        Camp runs from weekly from June 22 - August 21, 2026. Registration for Wild Pear
        Summer Camp 2027 opens March 1st 2027. Get <a href="#registration-notify">notified</a> when
        our schedule reopens.
      </p>
      <h3>Hours</h3>
      <p>
        Wild Pear's Summer Camp hours are 7:30am-3:00pm. 
      </p>
        <p>

          Camp opens at 7:30am, we close our doors at 8:30am to allow
          for us all to start our day together with a morning snack provided by Wild
          Pear.
        </p>
      <p>
        * Aftercare is available from 3-5pm, the cost is $175/week or $50/day and includes an
        afternoon snack.
      </p>
      <h3>Tuition</h3>
      <p>
        Summer camp at Wild Pear is $350/week. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Aftercare is available from 3:00pm-5:00pm for $175/wk or $50/day.
      </p>
      <p>
        Families wishing to use DHS/ERDC will need to pay for camp at the time of
        reservation; Wild Pear will reimburse you after DHS reimburses the facility.
      </p>
    </div>
      
      <h2>Registration</h2>
      <p>
        Registration opens annually on March 1st. <em
        >Please note: the "Younger Sibling Camp" and "Junior Camp Counselor"
        programs are only available to currently enrolled Wild Pear children
        (siblings) or Wild Pear alumni (counselors).
      </em>
    </p>
    
    <h2>What to Expect</h2>
    <p>
      Camp is offered for nine weeks during the summer. Each week, children are
      outside all day and have abundant opportunities to choose their own
      adventures: arts and crafts, building and tinkering, games and puzzles,
      gardening and food projects, sports and water play, and just enjoying
      being a kid outside in the summer. Each week also has its own theme,
      giving us a chance for some exciting, focused exploration of a particular
      topic.
    </p>

    <h2>Cancellation Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We understand that sometimes plans change. You can cancel your camp
      enrollment for a full refund before May 1st. After that, you can cancel 6
      weeks before camp for a 50% refund. We are unable to offer refunds for
      cancellations made less than 6 weeks before the start date, due to
      staffing commitments.
    </p>
  </ServicePage6>
  <SignupNewsletter
    id="registration-notify"
    title="Registration Reopens March 1, 2027"
    description="Summer 2026 registration has closed. Reach out and we'll add you to the list to be notified as soon as Summer 2027 camp details and registration go live."
    buttonText="Get Notified"
  />
  <Blog6 heading="2026 Weekly Themes" posts={summerWeeks} class="py-16" />

  <Contact />
</AboutLayout>
